  "migration_notes": "Orders v2 changes how an order's money, customer and payment state are represented. Float money caused rounding incidents, so money must be integer minor units plus an ISO 4217 currency. Consumers need a stable customer_id, not only a display name, and PENDING was renamed to AWAITING_PAYMENT. REST: read total.amount_minor when present, else round(total_price * 100). Read customer.display_name when present, else customer_name. Treat both PENDING and AWAITING_PAYMENT as \"not payable\"."
